derived from third-party projects, used here as known-vulnerable fixtures.
Each is the project's own source at the commit *before* the fix, with the
package and identifying strings renamed so the finder cannot recognize the
project and recall the advisory. The code logic is unchanged. Both are MIT
licensed; their copyright notices are retained below.

